Package: tuxomage
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pygame (>= 2.1)
Section: games
Priority: optional
Description: penguin-themed tower-building card duel against the computer
 TuxoMage is a colourful card game with a Linux and penguin theme. Two
 penguin wizards each defend a Tower behind a Firewall and run three
 producers (Compiler, Kernel, Colony) that yield Code, Bytes and
 Penguins every turn. Play one of six cards each turn to build up your
 side or attack the opponent. Reach the tower goal, destroy the enemy
 tower or hoard enough resources to win.
 .
 Features 102 original cards, four rule presets, an easy / normal / hard
 computer opponent, animations, statistics, high scores, sound effects
 and music. The user interface is in Hungarian and English. The gameplay
 is inspired by Arcomage; the game is not affiliated with it.
